// EXPECTED: compile error
// expect-error: never freed
// BUG-977: ONE PREDICATE, TWO QUESTIONS, OPPOSITE SAFE DIRECTIONS.
// ir_contains_move_struct_field_depth returned "contains a move struct" past depth 32.
// That is the conservative answer at the COPY sink (over-reject at worst) and the
// BACKWARDS one at the LEAK sink, where move-tracked locals are EXEMPT from leak
// checking — so the handle was registered alive and its leak went unreported.
// Fixed by making the walk TRI-STATE: each sink now picks its own reading of "the
// walk stopped". Reproducer from claude/loving-davinci-v6o9c5 (body verbatim).
